        <item>
            <title>1.0.6</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 14:21:41 +0800</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Lyle-xub/PiPanel/releases/tag/v1.0.6</link>
            <sparkle:version>12</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.6</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>PiPanel 1.0.6</h2>
                <p>优化画中画的资源占用、清晰度、鼠标交互和多窗口稳定性。</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>多个画中画共用一个虚拟显示器，减少显示器创建与桌面重排开销。</li>
                    <li>鼠标保持在物理桌面，进入小窗后自动映射；改善首次点击需要点两次的问题。</li>
                    <li>优化原生像素捕获与高清缩小显示，清晰度统一为高、中、低。</li>
                    <li>修复微信图片、视频预览及弹窗误替换聊天小窗内容的问题。</li>
                    <li>修复应用已有内置画中画时按钮识别错误、画面错位及显示不全的问题。</li>
                    <li>改善原生全屏、附属悬浮窗口、多文档窗口与关闭小窗后的窗口恢复。</li>
                </ul>
                <p>140 项自动化测试通过；支持 Apple Silicon 和 Intel Mac，安装包已签名并通过 Apple 公证。</p>
            ]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/Lyle-xub/PiPanel/releases/download/v1.0.6/PiPanel-1.0.6-macOS-universal.zip" length="15200855" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="sxdiJZ4isn+kNLFyGZ2wZHlfG+k8GTf3DrZV/OAXKKgG8KqevO0S15H7VAPVD14Gi+uuIqDCPLOxO9fWt9EbAA=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>1.0.5</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 21:27:37 +0800</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Lyle-xub/PiPanel/releases/tag/v1.0.5</link>
            <sparkle:version>11</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>PiPanel 1.0.5</h2>
                <p>修复窗口右上角画中画悬停开关的显示与遮挡问题。</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>修复开关穿透上方窗口、在来源窗口被遮挡时仍显示的问题。</li>
                    <li>修复鼠标光标和程序坞透明辅助层被误判为遮挡，导致悬停开关无法出现的问题。</li>
                    <li>鼠标静止时也会复查遮挡状态，点击前再次验证来源窗口。</li>
                    <li>保留普通窗口、浮动窗口和模态窗口的遮挡保护。</li>
                </ul>
                <p>支持 Apple Silicon 和 Intel Mac；安装包已签名并通过 Apple 公证。</p>
            ]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/Lyle-xub/PiPanel/releases/download/v1.0.5/PiPanel-1.0.5-macOS-universal.zip" length="15131805" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="6wixBIOA1EQhI05wqm3qVhjzkZO8Z+GqfKIJ4qgMGqC9NuasUYIoVwZiDVtv6l0njnJwV0k4X+JtJxN6daCsBw=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>1.0.3</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 20 Jul 2026 01:30:34 +0800</pubDate>
            <link>https://pipanel.app/</link>
            <sparkle:version>9</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>PiPanel 1.0.3</h2>
                <p>本次更新重点改善全屏窗口、受限尺寸窗口以及画中画重排过程的稳定性。</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>启动、窗口迁移和尺寸调整期间使用取色毛玻璃，画面稳定后再显示。</li>
                    <li>原生全屏时可直接缩放完整画面，并可从画中画边缘自然移出鼠标。</li>
                    <li>修复全屏后关闭画中画时源窗口未返回、Dock 未恢复的问题。</li>
                    <li>修复受尺寸限制的应用持续裁切、黑边和轻微溢出问题。</li>
                    <li>修复最小化或从 Dock 恢复其他应用时错误闪现毛玻璃的问题。</li>
                    <li>优化边缘交互反馈、缩放光标、关闭按钮悬停效果，并更新应用图标。</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/Lyle-xub/PiPanel/releases/download/v1.0.3/PiPanel-1.0.3-macOS-universal.zip" length="15133681" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="/BSXkCBTZqu95QzH8OaX6eHV9gGbnGbUEvcd5gQEAFLGXua8GyqgLejbnTDutlBzHYZQgUX3OXJ9M0czql82Bw=="/>
        </item>
